WEBVTT

00:00:01.040 --> 00:00:04.440
5 years ago...

00:00:06.520 --> 00:00:08.260
Hanako-san's there, apparently.

00:00:08.810 --> 00:00:10.000
Hanako-san?

00:00:11.810 --> 00:00:14.370
I heard Hanako-san's in 
the third floor bathroom.

00:00:14.370 --> 00:00:15.960
Really? That's scary.

00:00:15.960 --> 00:00:17.570
Everyone's saying they saw her.

00:00:17.570 --> 00:00:19.010
Let's go check it out together.

00:00:21.340 --> 00:00:24.310
I heard she comes out when 
you knock three times.

00:00:24.310 --> 00:00:25.980
That's so creepy.

00:00:28.360 --> 00:00:30.520
My friend said he saw her.

00:00:30.520 --> 00:00:31.320
Seriously?

00:00:31.320 --> 00:00:32.260
That's scary.

00:00:40.710 --> 00:00:43.350
Hanako-san, are you there?

00:02:15.990 --> 00:02:17.600
Morning.

00:02:15.990 --> 00:02:19.990
Hanako-san

00:02:18.500 --> 00:02:19.990
Hey.

00:02:21.020 --> 00:02:22.990
Rinne-sama, Rinne-sama!

00:02:23.900 --> 00:02:25.200
I have a money-maker!

00:02:25.990 --> 00:02:26.830
A money-maker?

00:02:27.170 --> 00:02:28.950
A wanted poster for an evil spirit!

00:02:30.590 --> 00:02:32.130
I-It's...

00:02:32.640 --> 00:02:34.800
A 100,000 yen bounty?!

00:02:35.270 --> 00:02:38.900
<i>Shinigamis receive wanted 
posters from the other world.</i>

00:02:38.900 --> 00:02:44.140
<i>It is part of a shinigami's duties 
to hunt down those evil spirits.</i>

00:02:44.600 --> 00:02:48.310
You've been in the red lately, Rinne-sama. 
You need to make some money.

00:02:48.310 --> 00:02:53.480
<i>And depending on the level of the 
evil spirit, they can earn high bounties.</i>

00:02:53.480 --> 00:02:56.670
This scribbly thing is worth 100,000 yen?

00:02:59.380 --> 00:03:00.690
<i>This is great!</i>

00:03:02.130 --> 00:03:04.660
<i>I'll make hunting it down my top priority.</i>

00:03:08.730 --> 00:03:09.660
Morning.

00:03:10.120 --> 00:03:11.670
Oh, Sakura-chan.

00:03:12.100 --> 00:03:13.740
What's going on?

00:03:13.740 --> 00:03:15.130
Look at this.

00:03:19.540 --> 00:03:20.630
Handprints?

00:03:20.630 --> 00:03:23.090
They're all over the ceiling, the windows...

00:03:23.650 --> 00:03:25.260
They look so...

00:03:25.260 --> 00:03:26.850
...creepy.

00:03:27.700 --> 00:03:29.900
These handprints are tiny, aren't they?

00:03:29.900 --> 00:03:31.430
Yeah, they're like...

00:03:31.430 --> 00:03:32.970
A kid's.

00:03:39.700 --> 00:03:41.280
Tsubasa-kun.

00:03:45.330 --> 00:03:46.490
Not to mention...

00:03:46.490 --> 00:03:48.540
Jumonji-kun's desk.

00:03:48.540 --> 00:03:50.660
Resent

00:03:49.110 --> 00:03:50.660
"Resent"?

00:03:51.220 --> 00:03:52.960
Tsubasa-kun, what's this?

00:03:53.360 --> 00:03:55.620
Don't worry, Mamiya-san.

00:03:55.620 --> 00:03:59.460
Let's ask whoever did this what they resent.

00:04:00.170 --> 00:04:02.220
Take this, Holy Ash!

00:04:09.210 --> 00:04:10.120
What the heck?

00:04:10.120 --> 00:04:10.930
What was that?

00:04:15.780 --> 00:04:16.810
You're not getting away!

00:04:17.400 --> 00:04:19.400
Wh-What was that?

00:04:19.400 --> 00:04:21.190
And what the heck is Jumonji?

00:04:21.190 --> 00:04:22.360
Tsubasa-kun.

00:04:31.620 --> 00:04:32.580
Rokudou-kun.

00:04:32.580 --> 00:04:33.290
Rokudou.

00:04:39.380 --> 00:04:40.660
Rokudou, move!

00:04:40.660 --> 00:04:42.340
I'm exorcising—

00:04:50.310 --> 00:04:51.440
Wait.

00:04:51.440 --> 00:04:53.100
<i>Rokudou-kun.</i>

00:04:55.440 --> 00:04:56.690
Yay!

00:04:56.690 --> 00:04:58.860
100,000 yen!

00:05:00.240 --> 00:05:01.560
It's a gift from heaven.

00:05:06.610 --> 00:05:07.550
It shrunk.

00:05:14.600 --> 00:05:16.730
What was that for?!

00:05:16.730 --> 00:05:20.020
What was that for?!

00:05:18.310 --> 00:05:21.170
<i>I can't sense the evil of a 
100,000 yen-worth evil spirit.</i>

00:05:22.580 --> 00:05:24.320
Let's set things straight.

00:05:24.320 --> 00:05:25.510
Who are you?

00:05:26.820 --> 00:05:28.180
Can't you tell?

00:05:28.560 --> 00:05:29.430
No.

00:05:30.790 --> 00:05:32.450
Hint: bathroom.

00:05:35.020 --> 00:05:37.470
Hint number two: elementary school.

00:05:41.990 --> 00:05:43.750
Do you really not know me?

00:05:44.900 --> 00:05:45.860
Do you, Rokumon?

00:05:48.790 --> 00:05:50.730
How could this be?!

00:05:50.070 --> 00:05:51.550
OMG

00:05:50.730 --> 00:05:54.450
Everyone used to know me back in the day!

00:05:55.800 --> 00:05:58.960
I used to be the star figure 
of elementary schools.

00:06:00.660 --> 00:06:02.820
I was always the subject 
of rumors amongst children.

00:06:03.240 --> 00:06:08.970
Many kids knocked at my door 
just to get a glimpse of me.

00:06:10.720 --> 00:06:15.970
But one day five years ago, <i>he</i> showed up.

00:06:18.840 --> 00:06:21.110
Hanako-san of the Toilet, prepare yourself!

00:06:23.770 --> 00:06:25.070
I'm exorcising you.

00:06:25.070 --> 00:06:26.360
Take this, Holy Ash!

00:06:30.250 --> 00:06:32.740
It was such a comfortable toilet.

00:06:32.740 --> 00:06:34.790
That stupid brat!

00:06:36.680 --> 00:06:41.960
I see, you're that one I thought 
I'd exorcised in elementary school.

00:06:42.490 --> 00:06:43.690
Jumonji.

00:06:43.690 --> 00:06:46.400
Rokudou-kun, who's that girl?

00:06:46.400 --> 00:06:48.220
Hanako-san of the Toilet.

00:06:49.090 --> 00:06:50.700
Oh, that makes sense.

00:06:50.700 --> 00:06:51.590
You're so slow!

00:06:52.030 --> 00:06:53.960
You outdated horror story.

00:06:53.960 --> 00:06:56.220
What miserable purpose are you here for now?

00:06:56.220 --> 00:06:57.530
Shut up!

00:06:57.530 --> 00:07:00.690
You drove me out of the bathroom.

00:07:01.690 --> 00:07:05.850
I've been wandering the skies ever since.

00:07:07.210 --> 00:07:09.900
So your exorcism was a failure.

00:07:12.370 --> 00:07:15.540
Hanako-san of the 
Toilet actually existed?

00:07:15.540 --> 00:07:17.120
And she's a spirit?

00:07:17.590 --> 00:07:21.380
No wonder I haven't heard about her lately.

00:07:21.380 --> 00:07:22.620
Shut up!

00:07:22.620 --> 00:07:25.160
Hanako-san, I understand your situation.

00:07:25.160 --> 00:07:26.630
Do you not care to rest in peace?

00:07:29.630 --> 00:07:33.220
I can't rest until I get revenge on this guy!

00:07:34.270 --> 00:07:37.910
You may look like an innocent 
child, but a spirit is a spirit.

00:07:37.910 --> 00:07:39.730
Try me, and I'll take you down.

00:07:40.290 --> 00:07:41.700
I like it.

00:07:41.700 --> 00:07:43.350
You got me last time...

00:07:47.170 --> 00:07:49.070
But it won't be so easy this time.

00:07:50.420 --> 00:07:52.360
Her evil aura just became really strong!

00:07:52.360 --> 00:07:52.990
This evil aura...

00:07:57.490 --> 00:07:59.650
<i>It doesn't seem like she's emitting it.</i>

00:08:00.200 --> 00:08:02.370
<i>It's more like it's being 
injected from outside.</i>

00:08:02.720 --> 00:08:04.580
Evil spirit, be gone!

00:08:06.110 --> 00:08:08.590
That won't work on me anymore!

00:08:11.560 --> 00:08:12.280
To—

00:08:12.280 --> 00:08:14.090
Toilet paper.

00:08:18.200 --> 00:08:19.710
Damn you!

00:08:19.710 --> 00:08:22.170
Hey! This is my room!

00:08:22.170 --> 00:08:24.600
That's kind of a crappy attack.

00:08:25.010 --> 00:08:27.170
Don't go thinking I'm done yet.

00:08:28.490 --> 00:08:29.470
She vanished.

00:08:29.470 --> 00:08:30.360
She's outside.

00:08:33.860 --> 00:08:35.360
See what you get!

00:08:37.400 --> 00:08:40.370
I have this old man on my side!

00:08:41.540 --> 00:08:42.370
It's huge.

00:08:44.130 --> 00:08:45.370
Let's go, old man!

00:08:46.250 --> 00:08:49.160
My revenge isn't over yet!

00:08:49.160 --> 00:08:50.490
Prepare yourselves!

00:08:58.300 --> 00:08:59.840
<i>That 100,000 yen—</i>

00:08:59.840 --> 00:09:03.770
<i>I mean, that spirit, 
is feeding Hanako-san power.</i>

00:09:08.550 --> 00:09:12.090
The spirit's name is Toichi.

00:09:12.090 --> 00:09:13.280
It's not just one individual.

00:09:13.570 --> 00:09:14.650
It isn't?

00:09:14.650 --> 00:09:30.000
Rest Area

00:09:14.650 --> 00:09:30.000
Rest Area

00:09:15.070 --> 00:09:19.100
It's a single evil spirit 
made of all sorts of spirits.

00:09:19.100 --> 00:09:23.060
You should go prepared. 
It could get dangerous.

00:09:23.800 --> 00:09:26.290
Hanako-san was borrowing its power.

00:09:26.290 --> 00:09:28.000
That's not good.

00:09:28.000 --> 00:09:30.000
We have to make her cut 
ties with it immediately.

00:09:30.610 --> 00:09:32.750
What do you mean, Grandma?

00:09:34.340 --> 00:09:40.590
I told you to stop calling me that.

00:09:44.460 --> 00:09:48.190
Hanako-san of the Toilet 
is normally a tame spirit.

00:09:48.190 --> 00:09:50.760
She doesn't have the ability to hurt people.

00:09:53.850 --> 00:10:00.220
She's essentially taken out a high-interest 
loan in order to get revenge.

00:10:01.200 --> 00:10:02.120
A loan?

00:10:02.420 --> 00:10:05.840
And just as the name Toichi suggests, 
the interest is ten-to-ten.

00:10:05.840 --> 00:10:07.410
Ten percent every ten days.

00:10:08.870 --> 00:10:10.670
What a rip-off!

00:10:12.250 --> 00:10:16.870
And the price she'll be made to pay...

00:10:26.490 --> 00:10:28.800
<i>You should go prepared.</i>

00:10:34.520 --> 00:10:40.030
5,000 yen

00:10:40.820 --> 00:10:43.000
A debt, huh?

00:10:51.620 --> 00:10:52.800
What is this?!

00:10:52.800 --> 00:10:54.420
The bathroom's a mess!

00:10:54.420 --> 00:10:57.550
Hanako was here!
 Stupid
Idiot

00:10:54.420 --> 00:10:57.550
Idiot
 Idiot

00:10:54.820 --> 00:10:57.550
Eww! It's so gross!

00:10:58.000 --> 00:10:59.720
The boy's bathroom is the same.

00:10:59.720 --> 00:11:02.050
Apparently all the bathrooms 
around school have been hit.

00:11:02.050 --> 00:11:06.560
Hanako was here!
 Stupid
Idiot

00:11:04.350 --> 00:11:06.560
Tsubasa

00:11:07.190 --> 00:11:08.340
<i>Hanako-san.</i>

00:11:09.370 --> 00:11:11.200
She's running rampant.

00:11:13.000 --> 00:11:14.230
Rokudou-kun.

00:11:17.240 --> 00:11:18.890
This is the girl's bathroom.

00:11:19.790 --> 00:11:21.630
It's an emergency. I have no choice.

00:11:22.350 --> 00:11:24.780
We have to do something, 
or it'll get dangerous.

00:11:24.780 --> 00:11:27.790
Dangerous? You mean we're in danger?

00:11:28.750 --> 00:11:32.210
No, Hanako-san herself.

00:11:34.200 --> 00:11:37.210
She has to pay a price for her power.

00:11:39.390 --> 00:11:43.470
Like the way powerful shinigami 
tools cost a lot of money?

00:11:44.790 --> 00:11:46.930
Y-Yeah, something like that.

00:11:51.370 --> 00:11:57.610
But come to think of it, 
I feel a bit sorry for Hanako-san.

00:11:59.240 --> 00:12:03.570
Think about the rumors we 
heard about her as kids.

00:12:03.570 --> 00:12:06.210
Even though she's famous,

00:12:06.210 --> 00:12:10.980
all she ever does is scare kids and 
lock them in the bathroom and stuff.

00:12:14.790 --> 00:12:24.100
Knowing Hanako-san is a restless spirit, 
though, a lot of things makes sense, now.

00:12:28.380 --> 00:12:29.620
Mamiya Sakura.

00:12:31.720 --> 00:12:35.170
It looks like the enemy is prepared 
for an all-or-nothing resistance.

00:12:35.170 --> 00:12:36.350
Tsubasa-kun.

00:12:36.350 --> 00:12:37.880
This is the girl's bathroom.

00:12:37.880 --> 00:12:38.940
Look who's talking!

00:12:39.470 --> 00:12:42.890
If that's what she wants to do, 
then I don't need to hold back.

00:12:42.890 --> 00:12:47.380
I'm going to exterminate Hanako of the 
Toilet as the evil spirit that she is.

00:12:51.330 --> 00:12:52.450
There!

00:12:54.250 --> 00:12:59.840
These Holy Ash bombs are a special 
blend, ten times richer than normal!

00:13:03.670 --> 00:13:04.780
<i>Hanako-san.</i>

00:13:06.680 --> 00:13:08.530
Dammit!

00:13:13.020 --> 00:13:14.200
Stop!

00:13:19.300 --> 00:13:20.130
Rokumon.

00:13:22.440 --> 00:13:23.110
Yes?

00:13:23.540 --> 00:13:25.860
I have something important to ask of you.

00:13:27.770 --> 00:13:29.520
Stop, Hanako!

00:13:39.850 --> 00:13:40.970
Old man!

00:13:40.970 --> 00:13:42.380
Old man!

00:13:44.350 --> 00:13:46.380
Hello, customer.

00:13:46.750 --> 00:13:48.460
I don't have enough power.

00:13:48.460 --> 00:13:50.170
Give me more.

00:13:50.170 --> 00:13:51.810
Up to the limit.

00:13:52.950 --> 00:13:55.430
Sure thing.

00:13:56.900 --> 00:13:59.400
You can't accept that power!

00:14:03.480 --> 00:14:06.150
Are you borrowing his power 
knowing what'll happen?

00:14:06.370 --> 00:14:08.070
Huh? What are you talking about?

00:14:09.480 --> 00:14:13.580
The price you pay for borrowing power 
that you don't have the means to repay...

00:14:13.930 --> 00:14:15.370
Is you, yourself.

00:14:15.370 --> 00:14:16.080
What?

00:14:16.610 --> 00:14:22.190
In other words, you'll be turned evil 
yourself, and absorbed into Toichi.

00:14:23.100 --> 00:14:26.950
It goes around lending power 
to weak spirits like you,

00:14:26.950 --> 00:14:30.260
absorbing them, and growing 
to the size it is now.

00:14:31.250 --> 00:14:35.180
That's even more of a reason 
to do something about it.

00:14:36.330 --> 00:14:37.440
Jumonji.

00:14:42.140 --> 00:14:45.570
Take this, 10x Blend Holy Ash Bombs!

00:14:51.510 --> 00:14:52.440
Bullseye.

00:14:52.440 --> 00:14:53.450
Rokudou-kun.

00:14:59.570 --> 00:15:00.960
Huh? It divided.

00:15:02.480 --> 00:15:04.960
That doesn't even tickle me.

00:15:05.370 --> 00:15:08.190
That's impossible. My Holy Ash didn't work.

00:15:08.190 --> 00:15:09.840
They look like dumplings.

00:15:10.370 --> 00:15:16.260
Now, Hanako, it's time you 
became part of my body.

00:15:16.470 --> 00:15:18.020
You never told me!

00:15:18.020 --> 00:15:20.160
Mamiya Sakura, Jumonji.

00:15:20.160 --> 00:15:21.880
Take care of Hanako-san.

00:15:24.590 --> 00:15:26.150
Okay, got it.

00:15:26.150 --> 00:15:29.860
Wait, Rokudou, can <i>you</i> do 
anything about that evil spirit?

00:15:31.320 --> 00:15:34.240
How dare you get in my way, boy!

00:15:41.560 --> 00:15:42.940
<i>Where are you, Rokumon?</i>

00:15:42.940 --> 00:15:44.180
Rinne-sama.

00:15:49.610 --> 00:15:50.440
Rokudou!

00:15:50.440 --> 00:15:51.130
Look out!

00:15:53.660 --> 00:15:55.890
Your shinigami scythe!

00:16:06.520 --> 00:16:08.650
That took you a while, Rokumon.

00:16:09.210 --> 00:16:10.480
Sorry.

00:16:10.480 --> 00:16:13.450
The old man at the pawn shop started 
asking for handling fees and stuff.

00:16:13.450 --> 00:16:14.240
Pawn shop?

00:16:14.890 --> 00:16:16.340
<i>The shinigami scythe.</i>

00:16:16.870 --> 00:16:18.570
<i>A must-have item for a shinigami,</i>

00:16:18.570 --> 00:16:21.420
<i>and this is the one Rinne has been 
using since he was little.</i>

00:16:21.420 --> 00:16:27.880
<i>However, as he became more poor, he sold his 
scythe at a pawn shop to make ends meet.</i>

00:16:28.750 --> 00:16:32.690
It's been a while, my scythe.

00:16:33.770 --> 00:16:37.890
It took me a whole 5,000 yen to 
get you out of the pawn shop.

00:16:38.130 --> 00:16:40.170
You can do it, Rinne-sama!

00:16:40.170 --> 00:16:42.510
For your 100,000 yen!

00:16:42.510 --> 00:16:43.770
100,000 yen?

00:16:45.630 --> 00:16:48.260
I can still make a profit.

00:16:49.350 --> 00:16:52.990
You give power to weak 
spirits, turn them evil,

00:16:52.990 --> 00:16:56.410
absorb them, and linger in this world.

00:16:56.410 --> 00:16:59.320
Evil spirit Toichi, surrender yourself.

00:16:59.790 --> 00:17:04.790
This shinigami scythe will purify you 
and direct you to the Rinne no Wa.

00:17:05.480 --> 00:17:07.540
<i>Shinigami scythe?</i>

00:17:08.570 --> 00:17:10.540
Foolish boy!

00:17:10.540 --> 00:17:13.560
Why would I go to the other world?

00:17:20.850 --> 00:17:23.180
Group One, purified!

00:17:25.850 --> 00:17:27.060
What's going on?

00:17:28.650 --> 00:17:29.670
I...

00:17:30.890 --> 00:17:33.530
I feel warm and fuzzy.

00:17:37.610 --> 00:17:39.120
They passed on?!

00:17:39.120 --> 00:17:40.700
That's my Rinne-sama!

00:17:40.990 --> 00:17:42.050
<i>Why?</i>

00:17:42.050 --> 00:17:44.790
<i>I couldn't exorcise them with my Holy Ash.</i>

00:17:45.620 --> 00:17:48.290
Group Two, step forward.

00:17:49.530 --> 00:17:52.980
Guys, wait. Yeah, let's do that.

00:17:57.220 --> 00:17:58.890
They're still after Hanako-san!

00:17:59.290 --> 00:18:02.140
Evil spirit Toichi, give up!
It's too late!

00:18:02.430 --> 00:18:03.900
No, it isn't.

00:18:03.900 --> 00:18:07.100
Hanako has strong resentment for having 
been driven out of her home unjustly.

00:18:07.100 --> 00:18:10.230
To an evil spirit, she is a source of power!

00:18:18.860 --> 00:18:20.020
Hanako of the Toilet!

00:18:20.020 --> 00:18:21.490
What, you idiot?

00:18:21.490 --> 00:18:23.850
I shouldn't have kicked 
you out of the bathroom.

00:18:23.850 --> 00:18:24.410
I'm sorry.

00:18:25.970 --> 00:18:27.350
<i>Tsubasa-kun.</i>

00:18:28.220 --> 00:18:30.830
<i>I didn't want to use this technique.</i>

00:18:33.950 --> 00:18:35.340
<i>He dropped his Holy Ash.</i>

00:18:35.800 --> 00:18:40.340
<i>But it seems I have the 
responsibility to protect Hanako.</i>

00:18:41.500 --> 00:18:42.430
<i>A Bible.</i>

00:18:42.730 --> 00:18:45.430
Do you really think a Bible 
can make me rest in peace?

00:18:50.670 --> 00:18:54.690
Bible Corner Crush!

00:18:55.710 --> 00:18:58.320
Creak...

00:18:56.570 --> 00:18:58.320
He hit him with the corner of the Bible!

00:19:00.130 --> 00:19:03.240
You shall not pass!

00:19:03.240 --> 00:19:05.070
Take that! Take that!

00:19:05.070 --> 00:19:08.890
Crush! Crush! Crush!

00:19:07.000 --> 00:19:08.360
Not bad, Jumonji.

00:19:08.890 --> 00:19:12.830
Being hit with the corner of a book 
hurts like hell, even for a spirit.

00:19:13.240 --> 00:19:15.740
<i>Please do not try this at home.</i>

00:19:18.230 --> 00:19:19.370
That's enough.

00:19:21.000 --> 00:19:22.340
Purify!

00:19:28.710 --> 00:19:30.730
Warm and fuzzy!

00:19:31.330 --> 00:19:33.480
Feels so good...

00:19:38.970 --> 00:19:41.080
Toichi passed on!

00:19:41.080 --> 00:19:42.200
Wow.

00:19:43.530 --> 00:19:44.690
Old man...

00:19:47.410 --> 00:19:48.640
What's wrong?

00:19:48.640 --> 00:19:50.330
You seem exhausted.

00:19:50.330 --> 00:19:53.000
I think I pushed myself a little too much.

00:19:53.410 --> 00:19:58.240
The Bible Corner Crush is a powerful 
technique that I can only use once a week.

00:19:58.240 --> 00:20:00.240
In terms of concentration and stuff.

00:20:01.480 --> 00:20:04.010
<i>It takes </i>that<i> much?</i>

00:20:04.370 --> 00:20:07.960
You used it to protect me?

00:20:08.390 --> 00:20:09.520
Why?

00:20:10.980 --> 00:20:13.620
You lost your home because of me.

00:20:13.620 --> 00:20:18.520
I wouldn't sleep well at night if you 
ended up falling prey to an evil spirit.

00:20:19.970 --> 00:20:22.780
I'm sorry, about everything.

00:20:25.590 --> 00:20:26.650
It's fine now.

00:20:30.150 --> 00:20:32.680
Now, what're you going to do, Hanako-san?

00:20:33.750 --> 00:20:37.170
If you want to get on the 
Rinne no Wa, I'll take you there.

00:20:38.710 --> 00:20:39.550
Okay.

00:20:40.350 --> 00:20:42.720
So you're going to rest in peace, 
huh, Hanako-san?

00:20:43.220 --> 00:20:45.340
I have no more regrets.

00:20:46.810 --> 00:20:51.030
It seems there's no place left for me here.

00:20:55.710 --> 00:20:56.630
Let's go.

00:20:57.440 --> 00:20:58.760
Rinne-sama.

00:20:58.760 --> 00:21:01.090
You have to claim your bounty first.

00:21:01.090 --> 00:21:01.940
Wuh?

00:21:02.210 --> 00:21:04.020
What do you mean, "Wuh"?

00:21:04.020 --> 00:21:06.660
It's 100,000 yen!

00:21:07.260 --> 00:21:09.970
Oh, right.

00:21:09.970 --> 00:21:11.540
You forgot about it?

00:21:12.000 --> 00:21:15.280
<i>Honestly, I completely forgot 
about it half way through.</i>

00:21:16.610 --> 00:21:17.320
<i>But...</i>

00:21:19.720 --> 00:21:21.690
<i>100,000 yen, though.</i>

00:21:25.960 --> 00:21:28.930
Mamiya-san, so what is he, anyway?

00:21:29.510 --> 00:21:31.060
He's like...

00:21:31.430 --> 00:21:33.680
A shinigami kind of thing.

00:21:33.680 --> 00:21:34.880
Rokudou is?

00:21:34.880 --> 00:21:35.820
Yeah.

00:21:35.820 --> 00:21:38.020
He's kind of a human thing, though.

00:21:40.210 --> 00:21:42.380
He's a kind shinigami.

00:21:43.840 --> 00:21:46.280
<i>Why do you make that face?</i>

00:21:47.270 --> 00:21:50.290
<i>Don't tell me you have feelings for Rokudou...</i>

00:21:53.430 --> 00:21:58.420
Huh? The debt collector 
took your 100,000 already?

00:22:00.810 --> 00:22:02.420
That's so sad.

00:22:03.600 --> 00:22:05.590
<i>Or is it pity?</i>

00:22:09.250 --> 00:22:10.300
All rise.

00:24:01.040 --> 00:24:25.980
Next Episode
 Voice of the Roadside Shrine

00:24:01.590 --> 00:24:03.580
That was too bad, about the 100,000 yen.

00:24:03.580 --> 00:24:04.080
Don't mention it.

00:24:04.080 --> 00:24:06.200
It was too much money for me, anyway.

00:24:06.200 --> 00:24:08.210
But you got your shinigami scythe back.

00:24:08.210 --> 00:24:09.040
Yeah!

00:24:09.040 --> 00:24:11.410
I'm going to use this scythe 
to work <i>really</i> hard.

00:24:11.410 --> 00:24:13.590
I'll make 10,000 yen someday, just watch.

00:24:13.590 --> 00:24:15.010
You just lost a digit.

00:24:15.010 --> 00:24:16.090
But that's the spirit.

00:24:16.090 --> 00:24:17.470
Let's do it, Rinne-sama.

00:24:17.470 --> 00:24:19.570
You're a hundred times stronger 
with your shinigami scythe.

00:24:19.570 --> 00:24:20.430
Yeah!

00:24:20.430 --> 00:24:23.480
Next time on <i>Rin-ne</i>: 
"Voice of the Roadside Shrine."

00:24:24.140 --> 00:24:27.140
With this scythe, 
I can purify any evil spirit.
